    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Splash combines a compact branded surface, loading indicator, determinate progress, status copy, and optional footer. The service API can host it in a borderless startup window, while the visual control can be previewed directly in Gallery.</source>
        <target state="translated">Splash 組合緊湊的品牌面板、載入指示、確定進度、狀態文案和可選頁腳。服務 API 可將它託管在無邊框啟動視窗中，視覺控件也可以直接在 Gallery 中預覽。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Present desktop startup progress before the main workspace is ready.</source>
        <target state="translated">在主工作區準備完成前呈現桌面啟動進度。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
